==Acquisition==
*Available for {{Nc|20}} creds from the [[Nightwave#Cred Offerings|Nightwave Cred Offerings]] store on a rotational basis.
*Rewarded after completing the [[Junction]] to [[Europa]] on [[Jupiter]].

==Notes==
*This can be stacked with other teammates' to increase the team's health by +{{Math|4 * 20%|bf-a=y|p=y}} of their base health.
*{{WF|Inaros Prime}} receives the largest bonus as his base health at rank 30 is 2415, giving him {{Math|2415*0.2|bf-a = y}} bonus health per aura. This can be further increased with {{M|Coaction Drift}} to {{Math|2415*0.2*1.15*1.15|bf-a = y}} health per aura.
*This mod does not affect [[Necramech|Necramechs]].

